        "type": "game",
        "name": "The Fifth Bell",
        "steam_appid": 4040030,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040030/extras/643a2dca270e79dba6d4253ece61d3b6.webp?t=1764340574\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fifth Bell — a mystical horror adventure inspired by an ancient legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Mark, a folklorist trapped in a series of cursed places — from a foggy village to an abandoned city, underground halls, and a hellish maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter holds its own goal, threat, and atmosphere. Sometimes you’ll need to seek mystical gifts, and sometimes — simply survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 chapters, each with unique mechanics and tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The relentless Reaper follows you with every toll of the bell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments — from dense fog to burning corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival tools — the locator, sprint, and light will only help you for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomness and tension — events and key item locations change each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since its release, The Fifth Bell has grown significantly: lighting improvements, new chapters, reworked atmosphere, and smarter enemy behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story now unveils more about the curse and the fate of those who failed to survive the Fifth Toll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you endure all the chapters and hear the final bell... or remain in its shadow?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040030/extras/643a2dca270e79dba6d4253ece61d3b6.webp?t=1764340574\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fifth Bell — a mystical horror adventure inspired by an ancient legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Mark, a folklorist trapped in a series of cursed places — from a foggy village to an abandoned city, underground halls, and a hellish maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter holds its own goal, threat, and atmosphere. Sometimes you’ll need to seek mystical gifts, and sometimes — simply survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 chapters, each with unique mechanics and tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The relentless Reaper follows you with every toll of the bell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments — from dense fog to burning corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival tools — the locator, sprint, and light will only help you for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomness and tension — events and key item locations change each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since its release, The Fifth Bell has grown significantly: lighting improvements, new chapters, reworked atmosphere, and smarter enemy behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story now unveils more about the curse and the fate of those who failed to survive the Fifth Toll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you endure all the chapters and hear the final bell... or remain in its shadow?</p>",
